title\">Excel实用技巧</div>\n<div class=\"course-price\">¥800</div>\n<div class=\"course-teacher\">刘老师</div>\n<a href=\"course-detail.html\" class=\"btn\">查看详情</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"category\">\n<h2>考试准备类课程</h2>\n<div class=\"course-card\">\n<img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/120x80?text=CET-4\" alt=\"CET-4\">\n<div class=\"course-info\">\n<div class=\"course-title\">CET-4考前押题班</div>\n<div class=\"course-price\">¥1300</div>\n<div class=\"course-teacher\">张老师</div>\n<a href=\"course-detail.html\" class=\"btn\">查看详情</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"course-card\">\n<img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/120x80?text=考研\" alt=\"考研\">\n<div class=\"course-info\">\n<div class=\"course-title\">考研综合能力提升</div>\n<div class=\"course-price\">¥1800</div>\n<div class=\"course-teacher\">周老师</div>\n<a href=\"course-detail.html\" class=\"btn\">查看详情</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n<p>&copy; 2025 学途 所有权利保留</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\nNow course-detail.html:\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>高级英语口语 - 课程详情</title>\n<style>\n/* CSS same as before */\nbody {font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:0; background:#f5f5f5; color:#333;}\n.container {max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}\nheader {background:#004d7a; color:#fff; padding:10px 0; text-align:center;}\nnav a {color:#fff; margin:0 15px; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px;}\nnav a:hover {text-decoration:underline;}\n.hero {background:url('https://via.placeholder.com/1200x300') no-repeat center/cover; height:300px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-size:24px; text-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);}\n.hero h1 {margin:0;}\n.detail-section {background:#fff; padding:20px; margin-top:30px; border-radius:5px; box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\n.detail-section h2 {margin-top:0;}\n.lesson-list {list-style-type:none; padding:0;}\n.lesson-list li {margin-bottom:15px; padding-bottom:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;}\n.lesson-title {font-weight:bold;}\n.teacher-info {margin-top:20px; padding-top:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd;}\n.teacher-info p {margin:5px 0;}\nfooter {background:#333; color:#ccc; text-align:center; padding:10px; margin-top:40px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<header>\n<h1>学途</h1>\n</header>\n<nav>\n<a href=\"course-list.html\">课程列表</a>\n<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n<a href=\"signup.html\">注册</a>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>高级英语口语</h1>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"detail-section\">\n<h2>课程概述</h2>\n<p>本课程旨在提升学员的英语口语表达能力，适合准备出国访学、职场沟通或各类英语考试的学生。课程共10节，每节时长2小时，采用情景模拟、角色扮演和即时反馈相结合的教学方式。</p>\n\n<h2>适用人群</h2>\n<p>大学本科及研究生、在职年轻专业人士，以及计划赴英美等国家进修的学生。</p>\n\n<h2>教师信息</h2>\n<div class=\"teacher-info\">\n<p><strong>李老师</strong>，北京外国语大学外语系硕士，多年英语口语教学经验，教学风格生动活泼，注重实用表达。</p>\n<p><strong>助教：</strong>张同学，曾在多家跨国公司担任英语培训顾问。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2>课程大纲</h2>\n<ul class=\"lesson-list\">\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第一节：常用表达与语气</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">学习常见问答、礼貌用语及语气变化。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第二节：会议与演讲技巧</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">学习如何在会议中自信表达观点，进行简短演讲。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第三节：职场沟通与邮件写作</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">掌握商务邮件撰写和口头沟通技巧。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第四节：旅行与文化交流</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">学习旅行中常用句型和文化常识。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第五节：考试模拟与答题技巧</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">针对雅思、托福等考试进行口语模拟。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第六节：小组讨论与辩论</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">提升小组交流和逻辑论证能力。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第七节：即兴演讲训练</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">培养即兴组织和表达能力。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第八节：自我介绍与个人陈述</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">学习自信介绍个人背景和优势。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第九节：情景角色扮演</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">通过角色扮演加强实际交际能力。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第十节：期末演示与评估</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">完成综合演示，教师给出反馈与评分。</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"btn\" style=\"margin-top:20px; background:#28a745; color:#fff; padding:10px 20px; border-radius:5px; text-decoration:none; display:inline-block;\">查看报名优惠</p>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n<p>&copy; 2025 学途 所有权利保留</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\nNow signup.html:\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>注册学途</title>\n<style>\n/* CSS similar */\nbody {font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:0; background:#f5f5f5; color:#333;}\n.container {max-width:800px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}\nheader {background:#004d7a; color:#fff; padding:10px 0; text-align:center;}\nnav a {color:#fff; margin:0 15px; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px;}\nnav a:hover {text-decoration:underline;}\n.hero {background:url('https://via.placeholder.com/800x200') no-repeat center/cover; height:200px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-size:24px; text-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);}\n.hero h1 {margin:0;}\nform {background:#fff; padding:20px; border-radius:5px; box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\nlabel {display:block; margin-top:15px; font-weight:bold;}\ninput[type=\"text\"], input[type=\"email\"], input[type=\"password\"] {width:100%; padding:8px; margin-top:5px; border:1px solid #ccc; border-radius:4px;}\nselect {width:100%; padding:8px; margin-top:5px; border:1px solid #ccc; border-radius:4px;}\nbutton {margin-top:20px; padding:10px 20px; background:#0066cc; color:#fff; border:none; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer;}\nbutton:hover {background:#004c99;}\nfooter {background:#333; color:#ccc; text-align:center; padding:10px; margin-top:40px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<header>\n<h1>学途 注册</h1>\n</header>\n\n<nav>\n<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n<a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n<a href=\"course-list.html\">课程列表</a>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>创建您的学习账号</h1>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"main\">\n<form action=\"#\" method=\"post\" onsubmit=\"return false;\">\n<label for=\"name\">姓名</label>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required>\n\n<label for=\"email\">邮箱</label>\n<input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required>\n\n<label for=\"password\">密码</label>\n<input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" required>\n\n<label for=\"confirm\">确认密码</label>\n<input type=\"password\" id=\"confirm\" name=\"confirm\" required>\n\n<label for=\"course\">想学习的课程</label>\n<select id=\"course\" name=\"course\" required>\n<option value=\"\">-- 请选择 --</option>\n<option value=\"高级英语口语\">高级英语口语</option>\n<option value=\"Python数据分析入门\">Python数据分析入门</option>\n<option value=\"CET-4考前押题班\">CET-4考前押题班</option>\n</select>\n\n<button type=\"submit\">立即注册</button>\n</form>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n<p>&copy; 2025 学途 所有权利保留</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\nCheck all visible strings are Chinese. Ensure no English words appear except class names, which are not visible. In the hero background URL we used placeholder image; that's okay as not visible text. Ensure all visible text is Chinese, e.g., \"学途\", \"首页\", \"关于我们\", \"课程列表\", \"注册\", \"高级英语口语\", \"查看详情\", etc. In course-detail, we have English words \"lesson-title\", \"lesson-desc\", but those are class names, not visible. The visible text includes \"第一节\", etc. All Chinese.\n\nMake sure no English words appear in visible text like \"Lorem ipsum\". I think it's fine.\n\nNow we have 5 files. Ensure we include exactly the format with file separators.\n\nLet's produce final answer.",
  "content": "===== FILE: index.html  =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>学途 - 在线学习平台</title>\n<style>\nbody {font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:0; background:#f5f5f5; color:#333;}\n.container {max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}\nheader {background:#004d7a; color:#fff; padding:10px 0; text-align:center;}\nnav a {color:#fff; margin:0 15px; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px;}\nnav a:hover {text-decoration:underline;}\n.hero {background:url('https://via.placeholder.com/1200x300') no-repeat center/cover; height:300px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-size:24px; text-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);}\n.hero h1 {margin:0;}\n.main {display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:20px; margin-top:30px;}\n.main img {width:100%; max-width:350px; height:auto; border-radius:5px;}\n.btn {display:inline-block; padding:10px 20px; background:#0066cc; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px; margin-top:15px;}\n.btn:hover {background:#004c99;}\nfooter {background:#333; color:#ccc; text-align:center; padding:10px; margin-top:40px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<header>\n<h1>学途</h1>\n</header>\n<nav>\n<a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n<a href=\"course-list.html\">课程列表</a>\n<a href=\"signup.html\">注册</a>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>提升技能，成就未来</h1>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"main\">\n<p>欢迎来到学途，这里为大学生和年轻专业人士提供语言学习、计算机技能和考试准备课程。我们的课程由资深教师授课，配以系统的教学资源，帮助您快速提升竞争力。</p>\n<img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/350x200?text=课程+特色\" alt=\"课程特色\">\n<a href=\"signup.html\" class=\"btn\">立即注册</a>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n<p>&copy; 2025 学途 所有权利保留</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: about.html  =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>关于学途</title>\n<style>\nbody {font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:0; background:#f5f5f5; color:#333;}\n.container {max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}\nheader {background:#004d7a; color:#fff; padding:10px 0; text-align:center;}\nnav a {color:#fff; margin:0 15px; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px;}\nnav a:hover {text-decoration:underline;}\n.hero {background:url('https://via.placeholder.com/1200x300') no-repeat center/cover; height:300px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-size:24px; text-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);}\n.hero h1 {margin:0;}\n.main {display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:20px; margin-top:30px;}\nfooter {background:#333; color:#ccc; text-align:center; padding:10px; margin-top:40px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<header>\n<h1>关于学途</h1>\n</header>\n<nav>\n<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n<a href=\"course-list.html\">课程列表</a>\n<a href=\"signup.html\">注册</a>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>学途简介</h1>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"main\">\n<h2>我们的使命</h2>\n<p>学途致力于为大学生和年轻专业人士提供高质量的在线学习资源，帮助他们在语言、计算机技能和考试准备方面获得优势，实现职业发展和个人成长。</p>\n\n<h2>发展历程</h2>\n<p>成立于2020年，学途最初是一个小型在线课程平台，经过几年的快速增长，已成为国内领先的学习平台，已有数万学员完成了各类课程。</p>\n\n<h2>师资力量</h2>\n<p>我们聘请来自国内顶级高校的资深教授和行业资深人士担任教师，确保教学质量和实践性。</p>\n\n<h2>联系方式</h2>\n<p>地址：北京市朝阳区学院路18号 学途大厦 10层<br>\n电话：010-1234-5678<br>\n邮箱：info@xuetong.cn</p>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n<p>&copy; 2025 学途 所有权利保留</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: course-list.html  =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>课程列表</title>\n<style>\nbody {font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:0; background:#f5f5f5; color:#333;}\n.container {max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}\nheader {background:#004d7a; color:#fff; padding:10px 0; text-align:center;}\nnav a {color:#fff; margin:0 15px; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px;}\nnav a:hover {text-decoration:underline;}\n.hero {background:url('https://via.placeholder.com/1200x300') no-repeat center/cover; height:300px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-size:24px; text-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);}\n.hero h1 {margin:0;}\n.category {margin-bottom:30px;}\n.course-card {background:#fff; padding:15px; margin:10px 0; border-radius:5px; box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;}\n.course-card img {width:120px; height:80px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:4px;}\n.course-info {flex-grow:1; margin-left:15px;}\n.course-title {font-weight:bold; margin:0;}\n.course-price {color:#e67e22; font-weight:bold;}\n.course-teacher {font-size:0.9em; color:#555;}\n.btn {background:#0066cc; color:#fff; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; margin-top:10px; display:inline-block;}\n.btn:hover {background:#004c99;}\nfooter {background:#333; color:#ccc; text-align:center; padding:10px; margin-top:40px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<header>\n<h1>课程列表</h1>\n</header>\n<nav>\n<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n<a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n<a href=\"signup.html\">注册</a>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>可选课程</h1>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"category\">\n<h2>语言类课程</h2>\n<div class=\"course-card\">\n<img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/120x80?text=英语\" alt=\"英语\">\n<div class=\"course-info\">\n<div class=\"course-title\">高级英语口语</div>\n<div class=\"course-price\">¥1200</div>\n<div class=\"course-teacher\">李老师</div>\n<a href=\"course-detail.html\" class=\"btn\">查看详情</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"course-card\">\n<img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/120x80?text=日语\" alt=\"日语\">\n<div class=\"course-info\">\n<div class=\"course-title\">商业日语基础</div>\n<div class=\"course-price\">¥950</div>\n<div class=\"course-teacher\">王老师</div>\n<a href=\"course-detail.html\" class=\"btn\">查看详情</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"category\">\n<h2>计算机技能类课程</h2>\n<div class=\"course-card\">\n<img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/120x80?text=Python\" alt=\"Python\">\n<div class=\"course-info\">\n<div class=\"course-title\">Python数据分析入门</div>\n<div class=\"course-price\">¥1500</div>\n<div class=\"course-teacher\">陈老师</div>\n<a href=\"course-detail.html\" class=\"btn\">查看详情</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"course-card\">\n<img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/120x80?text=Excel\" alt=\"Excel\">\n<div class=\"course-info\">\n<div class=\"course-title\">Excel实用技巧</div>\n<div class=\"course-price\">¥800</div>\n<div class=\"course-teacher\">刘老师</div>\n<a href=\"course-detail.html\" class=\"btn\">查看详情</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"category\">\n<h2>考试准备类课程</h2>\n<div class=\"course-card\">\n<img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/120x80?text=CET-4\" alt=\"CET-4\">\n<div class=\"course-info\">\n<div class=\"course-title\">CET-4考前押题班</div>\n<div class=\"course-price\">¥1300</div>\n<div class=\"course-teacher\">张老师</div>\n<a href=\"course-detail.html\" class=\"btn\">查看详情</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"course-card\">\n<img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/120x80?text=考研\" alt=\"考研\">\n<div class=\"course-info\">\n<div class=\"course-title\">考研综合能力提升</div>\n<div class=\"course-price\">¥1800</div>\n<div class=\"course-teacher\">周老师</div>\n<a href=\"course-detail.html\" class=\"btn\">查看详情</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n<p>&copy; 2025 学途 所有权利保留</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: course-detail.html  =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>高级英语口语 - 课程详情</title>\n<style>\nbody {font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:0; background:#f5f5f5; color:#333;}\n.container {max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}\nheader {background:#004d7a; color:#fff; padding:10px 0; text-align:center;}\nnav a {color:#fff; margin:0 15px; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px;}\nnav a:hover {text-decoration:underline;}\n.hero {background:url('https://via.placeholder.com/1200x300') no-repeat center/cover; height:300px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-size:24px; text-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);}\n.hero h1 {margin:0;}\n.detail-section {background:#fff; padding:20px; margin-top:30px; border-radius:5px; box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\n.detail-section h2 {margin-top:0;}\n.lesson-list {list-style-type:none; padding:0;}\n.lesson-list li {margin-bottom:15px; padding-bottom:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;}\n.lesson-title {font-weight:bold;}\n.teacher-info {margin-top:20px; padding-top:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd;}\n.teacher-info p {margin:5px 0;}\nfooter {background:#333; color:#ccc; text-align:center; padding:10px; margin-top:40px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<header>\n<h1>学途</h1>\n</header>\n<nav>\n<a href=\"course-list.html\">课程列表</a>\n<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n<a href=\"signup.html\">注册</a>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>高级英语口语</h1>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"detail-section\">\n<h2>课程概述</h2>\n<p>本课程旨在提升学员的英语口语表达能力，适合准备出国访学、职场沟通或各类英语考试的学生。课程共10节，每节时长2小时，采用情景模拟、角色扮演和即时反馈相结合的教学方式。</p>\n\n<h2>适用人群</h2>\n<p>大学本科及研究生、在职年轻专业人士，以及计划赴英美等国家进修的学生。</p>\n\n<h2>教师信息</h2>\n<div class=\"teacher-info\">\n<p><strong>李老师</strong>，北京外国语大学外语系硕士，多年英语口语教学经验，教学风格生动活泼，注重实用表达。</p>\n<p><strong>助教：</strong>张同学，曾在多家跨国公司担任英语培训顾问。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2>课程大纲</h2>\n<ul class=\"lesson-list\">\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第一节：常用表达与语气</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">学习常见问答、礼貌用语及语气变化。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第二节：会议与演讲技巧</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">学习如何在会议中自信表达观点，进行简短演讲。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第三节：职场沟通与邮件写作</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">掌握商务邮件撰写和口头沟通技巧。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第四节：旅行与文化交流</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">学习旅行中常用句型和文化常识。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第五节：考试模拟与答题技巧</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">针对雅思、托福等考试进行口语模拟。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第六节：小组讨论和辩论</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">提升小组交流和逻辑论证能力。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第七节：即兴演讲训练</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">培养即兴组织和表达能力。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第八节：自我介绍与个人陈述</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">学习自信介绍个人背景和优势。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第九节：情景角色扮演</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">通过角色扮演加强实际交际能力。</span></li>\n<li class=\"lesson-item\"><span class=\"lesson-title\">第十节：期末演示与评估</span> <span class=\"lesson-desc\">完成综合演示，教师给出反馈与评分。</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"btn\" style=\"margin-top:20px; background:#28a745; color:#fff; padding:10px 20px; border-radius:5px; text-decoration:none; display:inline-block;\">查看报名优惠</p>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n<p>&copy; 2025 学途 所有权利保留</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: signup.html  =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>注册学途</title>\n<style>\nbody {font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:0; background:#f5f5f5; color:#333;}\n.container {max-width:800px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}\nheader {background:#004d7a; color:#fff; padding:10px 0; text-align:center;}\nnav a {color:#fff; margin:0 15px; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px;}\nnav a:hover {text-decoration:underline;}\n.hero {background:url('https://via.placeholder.com/800x200') no-repeat center/cover; height:200px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-size:24px; text-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);}\n.hero h1 {margin:0;}\nform {background:#fff; padding:20px; border-radius:5px; box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\nlabel {display:block; margin-top:15px; font-weight:bold;}\ninput[type=\"text\"], input[type=\"email\"], input[type=\"password\"] {width:100%; padding:8px; margin-top:5px; border:1px solid #ccc; border-radius:4px;}\nselect {width:100%; padding:8px; margin-top:5px; border:1px solid #ccc; border-radius:4px;}\nbutton {margin-top:20px; padding:10px 20px; background:#0066cc; color:#fff; border:none; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer;}\nbutton:hover {background:#004c99;}\nfooter {background:#333; color:#ccc; text-align:center; padding:10px; margin-top:40px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<header>\n<h1>学途 注册</h1>\n</header>\n\n<nav>\n<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n<a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n<a href=\"course-list.html\">课程列表</a>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>创建您的学习账号</h1>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"main\">\n<form action=\"#\" method=\"post\" onsubmit=\"return false;\">\n<label for=\"name\">姓名</label>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required>\n\n<label for=\"email\">邮箱</label>\n<input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required>\n\n<label for=\"password\">密码</label>\n<input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" name=\"password\" required>\n\n<label for=\"confirm\">确认密码</label>\n<input type=\"password\" id=\"confirm\" name=\"confirm\" required>\n\n<label for=\"course\">想学习的课程</label>\n<select id=\"course\" name=\"course\" required>\n<option value=\"\">-- 请选择 --</option>\n<option value=\"高级英语口语\">高级英语口语</option>\n<option value=\"Python数据分析入门\">Python数据分析入门</option>\n<option value=\"CET-4考前押题班\">CET-4考前押题班</option>\n</select>\n\n<button type=\"submit\">立即注册</button>\n</form>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n<p>&copy; 2025 学途 所有权利保留</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
